An :INCLUDE inside a procedure body is not supported: include_in_procedure
(warning). include_early must not also report it (diag.include_in_procedure,
diag.include_early hand-off).
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE FormatAll;
	:INCLUDE Common.StringHelpers;
	:DECLARE nCount;
	nCount := 0;
	:RETURN nCount;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE FormatAll;
	:INCLUDE Common.StringHelpers;
	:DECLARE nCount;

	nCount := 0;

	:RETURN nCount;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
2:2-2:10 warning include_in_procedure: ':INCLUDE' inside a procedure body is not supported
